  "title": "Qt: Fix HeaderView height on macOS",
  "description": "macOS uses QMacStyle which produces a more compact native header height\nthan that generic formula. By overwriting size.height() in AdaptiveViewHeader,\nthe override throws away QMacStyle's compact native value and substitutes\nthe larger generic one. Net effect on macOS: a few pixels taller per header.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
